    "enUS": {
      "description": "I once was a knight like you--bound to the service of the light. Then, I died. It seems that we both have that much in common.\r\n\r\nUnlike you, however, I am bound to this place by a purpose unfinished, an oath unfulfilled. If you would listen, I would tell you of my quest... and my failure.",
